# Graefe revision — no remote push

When working on Graefe paper major revision (`graefe/major-revision-analyses`, `documentation/graefe_revision/**`, or related revision analyses):

- **Never** `git push` this revision branch (or related local revision commits) to the remote repository.
- Keep branch `graefe/major-revision-analyses` and work under `documentation/graefe_revision/` **local only**.
- Only push if the user **explicitly** asks to push in that turn.

Do not suggest or run push “for backup” or “to share” without an explicit user request.
